PROPRIETARY — ALL RIGHTS RESERVED (INTERNAL PLACEHOLDER)

This repository is private. No open-source licence has been chosen (ADR-0002).
No permission to use, copy, modify, distribute, publish or host this software
for third parties is granted. This notice is a placeholder, not a final licence.

Third-party components keep their own licences (see docs/dependency-strategy.md
and, from Phase 1, docs/third-party-licences.md).

Do not copy third-party source into this repository.
A final licence decision requires a new ADR, a dependency/data-licence review,
and qualified legal advice. Making the repository public or hosting it for others
requires that decision first.
